<title>POLAND: KRAKCHEMIA OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>KRAKCHEMIA OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.10 vs   0.16</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.15 vs   0.30</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.39 vs   0.53</p>
<p> Sales		   11.46 vs  10.13</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.57 vs   0.37</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.90 vs   0.79</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.20 vs   2.33</p>
<p> Sales		  104.27 vs  75.10</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish trading company is Krakchemia</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
